---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import EditorialProfile from './EditorialProfile.astro';
import { getColumnistProfiles } from '../lib/columnist-profiles.mjs';

type Variant = 'offer-news' | 'daily-tips';
const { variant = 'offer-news' } = Astro.props as { variant?: Variant };
const isNews = variant === 'offer-news';
const title = isNews ? 'A better way to cover a race-day offer' : 'Today’s horse racing tips and race notes';
const category = isNews ? 'Offer news' : 'Daily racing tips';
const related = isNews ? [
  { label: 'Bookmaker free bets', href: '/pilot/bookie-free-bets-bonus-offers/' },
  { label: 'Latest promotions', href: '/pilot/latest-betting-offers/' },
] : [
  { label: 'Dark Horse value tips', href: '/pilot/value-bet-tips-dark-horses/' },
  { label: 'Kempton racing tips', href: '/pilot/racecourses/kempton-racing-tips/' },
];
const { editor } = await getColumnistProfiles();
---
<BaseLayout title={`${title} — article pilot`} sidebar={true} relatedTopic="racing">
  <article class="article-pilot">
    <nav class="article-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/pilot/home/">EveryTip</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/pilot/free-betting-tips/">Free tips</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span>{category}</span></nav>
    <header class="article-head"><span class="article-category">{category} · template preview</span><h1>{title}</h1><p class="article-deck">{isNews ? 'An editorial hook around a genuine promotion, with the offer facts and terms supplied from one approved WordPress record.' : 'A clean daily post format for automated selections, with a human-editable opening and transparent source notes.'}</p><div class="article-meta"><span>EveryTip editorial team</span><span>Example date · updated date from WordPress</span><span>{isNews ? 'Offer verification pending' : 'Selections are illustrative'}</span></div></header>
    <div class="article-status"><strong>Design preview</strong><p>{isNews ? 'No promotion is active in this sample article. A real news story must link to a checked ACF offer record and show the approved compact terms wherever the offer appears.' : 'The runner and fixture examples below are invented. The published version should show the model run time and the daily import ID so corrections can be traced.'}</p></div>
    {isNews ? <>
      <p class="article-lede">A strong offer story starts with something happening today—a fixture, festival or change in the bookmaker’s rules—then answers the reader’s practical questions. Eric can change the headline and analysis in WordPress without modifying the offer terms.</p>
      <nav class="article-toc" aria-label="In this article"><strong>In this article</strong><a href="#why-now">Why it matters</a><a href="#offer">The offer</a><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a></nav>
      <section id="why-now"><h2>Why this is worth a closer look</h2><p>This is the editable editorial section. A published story would explain the event, what is genuinely new, and who might find the information useful. It should not repeat promotional wording as if it were independent analysis.</p><p>Internal links, images and quoted sources remain WordPress content. Astro keeps the typography, spacing, disclosures and structured offer placement consistent.</p></section>
      <aside id="offer" class="article-inline-offer"><div class="article-inline-brand"><span>Bookmaker offer</span><strong>Approved headline from ACF</strong></div><div class="article-inline-body"><p class="article-inline-disclosure">#Ad · 18+ · Eligibility to be checked</p><p>Compact terms, qualifying action, expiry and exclusions are read from the linked offer record. No terms are copied into this post.</p><span class="article-disabled" aria-label="Affiliate button disabled in template preview">Offer preview</span><details><summary>Full terms and source</summary><p>The published block will reveal the approved full terms and source link from that same record.</p></details></div></aside>
      <section id="how-it-works"><h2>What readers should check</h2><p>Spell out who can qualify, how to opt in, whether a qualifying bet has to settle, and when any reward expires. If the central offer record is not approved or has expired, the CTA must disappear automatically.</p></section>
    </> : <>
      <p class="article-lede">The introduction can be written by Eric or generated from an approved post template, while the selections themselves come from the dated tips import. This keeps the post quick to publish without hiding where the picks came from.</p>
      <section class="article-picks"><div class="article-picks-heading"><div><p class="kicker">Illustrative selections</p><h2>Today’s picks</h2></div><span>Import status: preview</span></div><div class="article-pick"><span>14:10 · Example course</span><strong>Example Runner A</strong><small>Selection and odds captured at publication, then linked to the canonical tip record.</small></div><div class="article-pick"><span>15:20 · Example course</span><strong>Example Runner B</strong><small>A correction changes the record with an audit note; it should not silently rewrite the original snapshot.</small></div></section>
      <section><h2>Race notes and reasoning</h2><p>Eric can add original insight here when it is available. Automated posts should use concise, factual wording and never invent analysis or imply human review that did not happen.</p></section>
      <aside class="article-inline-offer"><div class="article-inline-brand"><span>Optional placement</span><strong>Related bookmaker offer</strong></div><div class="article-inline-body"><p class="article-inline-disclosure">#Ad · 18+ · Offer preview</p><p>The ACF offer block can be inserted into a normal daily tip post. Country eligibility, current status and approved compact terms are resolved centrally.</p><span class="article-disabled" aria-label="Affiliate button disabled in template preview">Offer preview</span></div></aside>
      <section><h2>How these tips are produced</h2><p>The published page can explain the model and input-data boundaries, link to the relevant tips hub, and show the last import time. Results are not part of this first template pass.</p></section>
    </>}
    <aside class="article-newsletter"><div><p class="kicker">EveryTip email</p><h2>Get the next useful story</h2><p>ConvertBox remains the email capture tool for now. Its form mounts here without changing the article layout.</p></div><span>Newsletter form slot</span></aside>
    <section class="article-related"><h2>Keep reading</h2><div>{related.map((entry) => <a href={entry.href}>{entry.label} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>)}</div></section>
    <EditorialProfile profile={editor} />
    <footer class="article-footer"><p>Article copy, title, author, dates, SEO fields and revisions remain in WordPress. The template controls presentation; linked offer terms and structured selections are separate records.</p><p>18+ · Gamble responsibly.</p></footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .article-pilot{color:#263849}.article-breadcrumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;color:#697989;font-size:12px;margin:0 0 22px}.article-head{border-top:5px solid var(--et-orange);padding:22px 0 19px}.article-category{color:#a34e0b;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.article-head h1{font-size:clamp(32px,3.6vw,46px);margin:8px 0 12px}.article-deck{max-width:760px;font-size:18px;color:#526778}.article-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px 16px;color:#627687;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.article-status{padding:13px 16px;margin:4px 0 24px;background:#fff3e9;border-left:4px solid var(--et-orange);font-size:12px}.article-status p{margin:4px 0 0}.article-lede{font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#304c60}.article-toc{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px 14px;padding:15px;background:#edf5fa}.article-toc strong{width:100%;font-size:12px}.article-toc a{font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.article-pilot section:not(.article-picks):not(.article-related){margin-top:30px}.article-pilot section h2{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:25px}.article-pilot section p{max-width:770px}.article-inline-offer{display:grid;grid-template-columns:180px minmax(0,1fr);margin:32px 0;border:1px solid #d5e2ea;border-left:5px solid var(--et-orange)}.article-inline-brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:18px;background:#1d5f94;color:#fff}.article-inline-brand span{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.article-inline-brand strong{margin-top:7px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.2}.article-inline-body{padding:18px}.article-inline-body p{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px}.article-inline-disclosure{font-size:11px!important;font-weight:800;color:#a74a04}.article-disabled{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--et-commercial);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;cursor:not-allowed}.article-inline-body details{margin-top:12px;font-size:12px}.article-inline-body summary{cursor:pointer;color:#1b5f95;font-weight:800}.article-picks{margin:30px 0;padding:19px;background:#eef5fa}.article-picks-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;align-items:end}.article-picks-heading h2{margin:0}.article-picks-heading .kicker{margin:0}.article-picks-heading span{color:#607484;font-size:11px}.article-pick{display:grid;grid-template-columns:145px 1fr;gap:7px 12px;align-items:center;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #d6e5ef}.article-pick:first-of-type{margin-top:12px}.article-pick span{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:#2a658e}.article-pick strong{font-size:16px}.article-pick small{grid-column:2;color:#677987}.article-newsletter{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:15px;margin-top:40px;padding:19px 21px;border-top:4px solid var(--et-orange);background:#edf5fa}.article-newsletter h2{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:22px}.article-newsletter p:not(.kicker){margin:0;font-size:13px}.article-newsletter>span{flex:none;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:22px;background:var(--et-newsletter);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.article-related{margin-top:35px}.article-related h2{margin:0 0 12px}.article-related>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:9px}.article-related a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:12px;background:#eff5f9;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}.article-related a span{color:var(--et-orange)}.article-footer{margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid #dce5eb;padding-top:12px;color:#607484;font-size:11px}.article-footer p{margin:4px 0}@media(max-width:620px){.article-head{padding-top:17px}.article-deck,.article-lede{font-size:16px}.article-inline-offer{grid-template-columns:1fr}.article-inline-brand{min-height:90px}.article-pick{grid-template-columns:1fr}.article-pick small{grid-column:1}.article-newsletter{display:block}.article-newsletter>span{display:inline-block;margin-top:13px}.article-related>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
